  "details": "An option to change how often the client syncs its pose with other clients would be greatly appreciated.\nThis would help to improve accuracy when dancing/doing other precision-critical tasks.\n\nMaybe this could be a world setting? Or a client setting hidden in the config file? I'm unsure of the performance impact the update rate has, but it feels like it has been lowered in the 'Network IK' update.\n\nIf the devs think the inaccuracy issue will be resolved by better/faster interpolation or something instead in the near future, I'd love to know though. :)",
